# Start: the CLOUD hub, focus on BACK UP TO THE CLOUD (where
# to-manage-cloud-storage.steps leaves it). End: the transfer page after a
# match, finished, waiting for any button.
# MATCH THIS DEVICE TO THE CLOUD is the third row of BACKUP AND RESTORE. A
# opens the compare (COMPARING YOUR ROMS AND BIOS FILES WITH THE CLOUD), a
# network round trip per selected system; the confirmation follows. Needs
# the seed fixture (cloud-test-backend seed-content + seed-device) so the
# device holds ROMs the cloud does not -- gb entirely, snes/deviceonly.sfc --
# and the preview has something to list. YES is the first button.
#
# Neither A press is re-sent: both start network work, and the settle after
# each is what waits for it rather than a guess at how long it takes.
key down
wait-for-change
key down
wait-for-change
settle
shot cloud-hub-match-row
key x
wait-for-change 25 0
settle 40
shot match-confirm
key x
wait-for-change 25 0
settle 60
shot match-done
